        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Snow Pink\n- Organizations: Apink, Plan A Entertainment, A Cube Entertainment\n- Places: South Korea\n- Topics: extended plays, girl groups\n\nFacts:\n- In 2011, Apink was formed in South Korea as a girl group by Plan A Entertainment, which was formerly called A Cube Entertainment.\n- Apink is also written as A Pink and has the Korean name 에이핑크 and the Japanese name エーピンク.\n- Snow Pink is the second extended play by Apink.",
